  "description": "Fuaran.Program.UI — the UI adapter for the domain-generic bounded program core: the UI witness (the UI tier's action union, node tree, binding store, tree-ops and client effects seen through the core's witness contract), the pre-0.6.0 names as aliases over it, and the UI transport loop (the bounded driver, its channel glue and the client runtime). Fable-clean. Released in the same version as the core it instantiates. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
